# Design Tokens Architecture

**Owner:** token
**Scope:** Token system architecture for Tailwind 4 + shadcn/ui + Figma sync.

## Files token owns

### 1. `tokens.css` — `:root` + `.dark` blocks
HSL CSS custom properties. Semantic naming only (no `--blue-500`).

```css
:root {
  --color-primary: 222 47% 31%;
  --color-primary-foreground: 0 0% 100%;
  --color-background: 0 0% 100%;
  --color-foreground: 222 47% 11%;
  --color-muted: 220 14% 96%;
  --color-muted-foreground: 215 16% 47%;
  --color-border: 220 13% 91%;
  --color-card: 0 0% 100%;
  --color-destructive: 0 84% 60%;

  --space-1: 0.25rem;
  --space-2: 0.5rem;
  --space-3: 0.75rem;
  --space-4: 1rem;
  --space-6: 1.5rem;
  --space-8: 2rem;
  --space-12: 3rem;
  --space-16: 4rem;
  --space-20: 5rem;

  --radius-sm: 0.25rem;
  --radius-md: 0.5rem;
  --radius-lg: 0.75rem;
  --radius-xl: 1rem;
  --radius-full: 9999px;

  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px hsl(0 0% 0% / 0.05);
  --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px hsl(0 0% 0% / 0.1);
  --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px hsl(0 0% 0% / 0.1);

  --duration-instant: 100ms;
  --duration-fast: 200ms;
  --duration-base: 300ms;
  --duration-slow: 500ms;

  --easing-out: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  --easing-in-out: cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1);
  --easing-spring: cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
}

.dark {
  --color-primary: 222 47% 71%;
  --color-primary-foreground: 222 47% 11%;
  --color-background: 222 20% 7%;
  --color-foreground: 0 0% 95%;
  --color-muted: 217 20% 15%;
  --color-muted-foreground: 215 16% 65%;
  --color-border: 217 20% 20%;
  --color-card: 222 20% 9%;
  --color-destructive: 0 70% 50%;
}
```

### 2. `tailwind.config.ts` theme.extend block
Maps CSS vars to Tailwind utilities.
- `colors: { primary: 'hsl(var(--color-primary))', ... }`
- Custom animation utilities tied to duration vars

### 3. shadcn theme registry JSON
For shadcn/ui CLI to install components with project tokens.
Mirrors `:root` + `.dark` blocks in JSON form.

## Variant matrix

For each interactive token (button, input, link):
- default
- hover (lighten 5% in light mode, darken 5% in dark)
- active (lighten 10% / darken 10%)
- disabled (50% opacity)
- focus (ring-2 ring-primary ring-offset-2)

## Semantic naming rules
- Color: `bg-{role}` / `text-{role}` / `border-{role}` / `ring-{role}`
- Roles: primary, secondary, accent, muted, destructive, success, warning, surface, foreground
- NEVER literal: no `--blue-500`, no `--gray-100`

## Contrast validation
- Text-on-bg ≥ 4.5:1 (body), 3:1 (large/UI)
- Run validator: `pnpm dlx wcag-contrast-checker tokens.css`
- Both light + dark validated

## OKLCH for ramp generation
- Use OKLCH color space for perceptually-uniform lightness ramps
- Tools: culori npm package, online OKLCH picker
- Generate 50/100/200/.../900 ramp from base color

## Updates
- Token gap from elio/pixel/spark → triage decision (extend core vs one-off)
- Brand kit change from Vega → bootstrap full token set
- Polaris version bump (Stack B) → re-run bridge mapping

