## Curriculum v1 — Session 5 Patches (2026-04-27)

**Source:** FIG-003 · changelog: `~/.claude/memory/training/cycle-ecom-v1-session-5-changelog.md`

### Library Promotion — 3-Project Threshold (FIG-003)
Project-specific custom components stay project-local until proven across multiple projects.

**Promotion rule (matches decoder pattern threshold):**
| Usage count | Status |
|-------------|--------|
| 1 project | Project-local only |
| 2 projects | Project-local + flagged for cross-project review |
| **3+ projects** | **Promote to canonical library** (subject to vega + figma-synth review) |

**At 3rd project:**
1. Figma-synth + vega review for canonicalization
2. Check generic-enough (no project-specific business logic)
3. If approved → promote to `~/.claude/memory/patterns/good/ecom-code-connect-mappings.md`
4. If rejected → mark `project-specific` permanent tag, never re-review

Same threshold as decoder pattern promotion = consistency across HR systems.

