## Hydrogen-native component mappings

Hydrogen ships its own RSC primitives. Map these BEFORE any custom ecom components.

### Hydrogen `<Image>` (priority CDN)
```tsx
import { figma } from "@figma/code-connect"
import { Image } from "@shopify/hydrogen"

figma.connect(Image, "FIGMA_NODE_URL", {
  props: {
    aspectRatio: figma.enum("Ratio", {
      "Square 1:1": "1/1",
      "Portrait 4:5": "4/5",
      "Landscape 16:9": "16/9",
    }),
    loading: figma.enum("Loading", { "Eager (hero)": "eager", "Lazy": "lazy" }),
    alt: figma.string("Alt"),
  },
  example: ({ aspectRatio, loading, alt }) => (
    <Image data={product.featuredImage} aspectRatio={aspectRatio} loading={loading} alt={alt} />
  ),
})
```

### Hydrogen `<Money>` (price formatting)
```tsx
import { Money } from "@shopify/hydrogen"

figma.connect(Money, "FIGMA_NODE_URL", {
  props: {
    showCompareAt: figma.boolean("Show Compare At"),
    withoutTrailingZeros: figma.boolean("No Trailing Zeros"),
  },
  example: ({ showCompareAt }) => (
    <div>
      <Money data={product.priceRange.minVariantPrice} />
      {showCompareAt && product.compareAtPriceRange?.minVariantPrice && (
        <Money className="line-through text-muted" data={product.compareAtPriceRange.minVariantPrice} />
      )}
    </div>
  ),
})
```

### Hydrogen `<AddToCartButton>` (cart server action)
```tsx
import { AddToCartButton } from "@shopify/hydrogen"

figma.connect(AddToCartButton, "FIGMA_NODE_URL", {
  props: {
    label: figma.string("Label"),
    variant: figma.enum("Variant", {
      "Primary": "primary",
      "Sticky Mobile": "sticky-mobile",
    }),
    disabled: figma.boolean("Disabled"),
  },
  example: ({ label, variant }) => (
    <AddToCartButton
      lines={[{ merchandiseId: selectedVariant.id, quantity: 1 }]}
      className={variant === 'sticky-mobile' ? 'fixed bottom-0 inset-x-0' : ''}
    >
      {label}
    </AddToCartButton>
  ),
})
```

### Hydrogen `<CartForm>` (mutation wrapper)
```tsx
import { CartForm } from "@shopify/hydrogen"

figma.connect(CartForm, "FIGMA_NODE_URL", {
  props: {
    action: figma.enum("Action", {
      "Lines Add": CartForm.ACTIONS.LinesAdd,
      "Lines Update": CartForm.ACTIONS.LinesUpdate,
      "Lines Remove": CartForm.ACTIONS.LinesRemove,
      "Discount Codes Update": CartForm.ACTIONS.DiscountCodesUpdate,
    }),
  },
  example: ({ action }) => (
    <CartForm route="/cart" action={action} inputs={{ lines: [] }}>
      {(fetcher) => <button type="submit">{fetcher.state !== 'idle' ? 'Loading...' : 'Apply'}</button>}
    </CartForm>
  ),
})
```

### Hydrogen `<VariantSelector>` (option iteration)
```tsx
import { VariantSelector } from "@shopify/hydrogen"

figma.connect(VariantSelector, "FIGMA_NODE_URL", {
  props: {
    optionType: figma.enum("Option", {
      "Color Swatch": "Color",
      "Size": "Size",
      "Material": "Material",
    }),
    swatchStyle: figma.enum("Swatch Style", {
      "Grid (≤8)": "grid",
      "Hybrid": "hybrid",
      "Dropdown (>20)": "dropdown",
    }),
  },
  example: ({ optionType }) => (
    <VariantSelector handle={product.handle} options={product.options}>
      {({ option }) => option.name === optionType && (
        <div className="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {option.values.map(({ value, isAvailable, isActive, to }) => (
            <Link key={value} to={to} className={isActive ? 'ring-2 ring-primary' : ''}>
              {value}
            </Link>
          ))}
        </div>
      )}
    </VariantSelector>
  ),
})
```

## FIGMA_NODE_URL discovery protocol

Never guess node URLs. Discover them:
1. `mcp__claude_ai_Figma__get_metadata` on project file → find component page
2. `mcp__claude_ai_Figma__search_design_system` with component name → returns nodeId
3. `mcp__claude_ai_Figma__get_code_connect_suggestions` → returns unmapped components with node IDs
4. Construct URL: `https://www.figma.com/design/{fileKey}/?node-id={nodeId}`

## Shopify Figma UI Kit
Shopify ships an official Figma resource with Polaris components.
- Use `get_libraries` to check if project has Shopify UI Kit linked
- **Admin embed components**: map TO Polaris Figma frames (in Shopify UI Kit)
- **Storefront components**: map TO brand-custom Figma frames (NOT Polaris)
- Never cross-map: `AddToCartButton` (storefront) → Polaris Button frame. Wrong design context.

## Reuse protocol
- New ecom build: copy these templates to project's `components/*.figma.tsx`
- Update FIGMA_NODE_URL per project (use discovery protocol above)
- Add project-specific variants if needed
- Register all via `send_code_connect_mappings`
- Hydrogen components register to storefront Figma file, NOT admin file

## Maintenance
- This file updated whenever a canonical ecom component evolves
- Cross-reference with elio's surface library for component coverage
- Hydrogen package updates may change prop signatures — audit on `@shopify/hydrogen` bump

